| forward_backward | 184.661 ± 124.523 ms / 4.060 GiB | 145.688 ± 0.455 ms / 4.060 GiB | 145.994 ± 0.384 ms / 4.060 GiB | 145.316 ± 0.350 ms / 4.060 GiB |
